# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every OS. The shared
# fixtures are read byte-for-byte by pytest, Jest and Rust, and a CRLF checkout on Windows would make
# them disagree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
